# Local mode and database checks need no environment variables.
# Never put service-role keys, passwords, or platform tokens in extension code.
# Client-side environment variables are bundled into the extension and are public.
# Step 11: copy to .env and configure these public values to enable sign-in.
# Use a project origin with no trailing slash and a publishable key.
# WXT_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co
# WXT_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=YOUR_PUBLIC_PUBLISHABLE_KEY
# Server-only secrets belong in the deployment secret store, never WXT_* variables.
